#
#   style_invalidation - CSS::compute_property_invalidation: what a change of one computed
#                        property requires (repaint, relayout, a new layout tree, ...)
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleInvalidation.cpp (lines 1-155) and the inline members of
#       StyleInvalidation.h (lines 13-31): RequiredInvalidationAfterStyleChange and the
#       per-property decision, including whether a value creates a stacking context.
